  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'back-necklace-boho-turquoise-lariat-jewelry-custom-size-leather-necklace-bohemia', '4312931469', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4312931469/back-necklace-boho-turquoise-lariat?click_key=EuMhKOe2UTn7Xupp6hNYRoqS-xb4%3ALTe637a7de5433ba871fe298abb9fcad1dfad8026e&click_sum=d22092f2&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-970640-16-12&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1',
   'Back Necklace Boho – Turquoise Lariat Jewelry • Custom Size Leather Necklace • Bohemian Jewelry for Women • Gift for Her', 'Boho Back Necklace • Turquoise Lariat Jewelry • Custom Size Leather Necklace • Bohemian Jewelry for Women This boho lariat necklace is a versatile piece designed to flow naturally with your body — worn as a statement front necklace, a delicate back necklace, or layered with your favorite looks. Made with genuine flat leather and a turquoise bar pendant, it''s the perfect mix of minimalist style and earthy elegance. The silver-plated bead can be removed and reinserted, making it easy to adapt the design to your personal style. 💎 Now available in multiple colors — match it with your mood, your dress, or your inner wildness. Choose from a range of tones and let it become your favorite everyday talisman. ✨ Details • Flat leather cord – not adjustable • Custom sizes available • Silver-plated bead (nickel & lead free, 8 microns sterling silver) • Turquoise howlite stone bar pendant – approx. 5 cm / 2 inches • Model wears 45 cm / 18" length • Request your preferred length in the "note to seller" box or pm 🎁 Perfect for: Back Jewelry • Boho Style Gift • Custom Necklace for Women • Mom Jewelry Gift • Handmade Birthday Gift • Festival Jewelry • Bridesmaid Gift ✍🏻 Want a perfect fit? Just leave your total length at checkout. All pieces are handmade and can be custom sized at no extra cost. 💫 Each necklace is handcrafted in small batches with care, intention and love. Original design by PrimitivaWorld ❤️ CLICK on the following links to see more jewelry: 👉🏻Earrings: https://etsy.me/3XFYC7i 👉🏻Similar Designs: https://etsy.me/3UWVDXu ☘️ Every single item is handcrafted to order with care. ❤️ SAVE this jewelry design in your favorites by clicking on the little heart at the top right of the pic and FAVORITE the shop to see updates of NEW designs. Your FAVORITES, LIKES & SHARES will be very much appreciated ❤️ 💌 Please feel free to contact me if you have any question. 🌻 Thank you for coming into my shop. Enjoy visiting 🌻 Manufacturer(s): PrimitivaWorld by Fefe Email: primit', 'statement-pieces',
