  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'natural-kingman-turquoise-silver-cuff-bracelet-vintage-filigree-boho-gemstone-ba', '4573744057', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4573744057/natural-kingman-turquoise-silver-cuff?click_key=EuMhKOe2UTn7Xupp6hNYRoqS-xb4%3ALT0dbd3d693340a6732be13ebb6372d3b67d78e936&click_sum=2fb0aa64&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-970640-16-11&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&cns=1',
   'Natural Kingman Turquoise Silver Cuff Bracelet Vintage Filigree Boho Gemstone Bangle For Her', 'Natural Kingman Turquoise Silver Cuff Bracelet Vintage Filigree Boho Gemstone Bangle For Her Description Discover the unmatched beauty of authentic Southwestern craftsmanship with this Genuine Kingman Turquoise Silver Cuff Bracelet. Expertly crafted for jewelry lovers who appreciate fine detail, this piece features a high-grade, natural Kingman turquoise cabochon set as the focal point. Known worldwide for its brilliant sky-blue hues, intricate matrix patterns, and historical significance from the famous Kingman mine in Arizona, the gemstone in this bracelet ensures your piece is truly one-of-a-kind. Artisanal Filigree & Detailed Metalwork: The gemstone is set within a broad, bold silver cuff that showcases vintage filigree metalwork. Sweeping scrollwork patterns, detailed side engravings, and a meticulously textured beaded bezel frame the center turquoise stone. The silver is finished with deliberate vintage oxidation, darkening the deep crevices of the metal to accentuate every swirl, curve, and detail, giving the piece a rich antique aesthetic. Versatile Style & Comfort: This statement bracelet offers a striking balance between bohemian elegance and rugged Southwestern flair. Designed as an open cuff, it can be gently adjusted for a custom, comfortable fit on most wrist sizes. It layers effortlessly with thin silver bangles, stacks beautifully with leather accessories, or stands strong on its own as a show-stopping solo piece. Product Specifications: Gemstone: 100% Genuine Natural Kingman Turquoise (Oval Cabochon) Material: Fine 925 Sterling Silver finish over durable alloy base, oxidized for antique contrast Bracelet Type: Wide open-cuff bangle (slightly flexible for easy sizing) Aesthetic: Southwestern, Boho-Chic, Vintage Filigree, Tribal Statement Finish: Polished highlights with dark oxidized accenting The Perfect Gift: Whether treating yourself or shopping for someone special, this Kingman turquoise bracelet makes a memorable gift for birthdays, anniversarie', 'turquoise-jewelry',
