  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'handmade-kingman-turquoise-925-sterling-silver-cuff-southwestern-boho-bangle-ann', '4587643225', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4587643225/kingman-turquoise-bracelet-sterling?click_key=EuMhKOe2UTn7Xupp6hNYRoqS-xb4%3ALT070d4d8cbd09875f683aff306773d3801d2fc90f&click_sum=cbd41c74&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-970640-16-9&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1',
   'Handmade Kingman Turquoise, 925 Sterling Silver Cuff, Southwestern Boho Bangle, Anniversary Gift, Celestial Jewelry', 'Add a touch of Southwestern beauty to your jewelry collection with this handcrafted Kingman Turquoise silver cuff bracelet. Featuring natural turquoise cabochons set across an elegant silver cuff, this piece combines rustic character with timeless boho style. Each turquoise stone has its own natural color variations and matrix patterns, making every bracelet unique. The oxidized silver detailing around the stones gives the bracelet a vintage, handcrafted appearance. ✨ Details: • Natural Kingman Turquoise stones • Sterling silver cuff design • Handmade jewelry • Southwestern / boho inspired style • Open cuff design for easy wearing • Natural turquoise variations make each piece unique • Perfect for everyday wear or special occasions • Beautiful gift for women who love turquoise jewelry Perfect For: Turquoise lovers, boho jewelry collectors, Southwestern style outfits, birthdays, anniversaries, Christmas gifts, Mother''s Day, and everyday statement jewelry. Materials: Kingman Turquoise, Sterling Silver Style: Boho • Southwestern • Rustic • Vintage Inspired • Handmade Care Instructions: Avoid prolonged contact with water, perfumes, lotions, and harsh chemicals. Store separately in a dry jewelry pouch when not being worn. Note: Natural gemstones may vary slightly in color, matrix, shape, and pattern. These natural variations are part of the beauty of genuine turquoise.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
