  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'white-water-turquoise-sterling-silver-ear-cuff-boho-festival-jewelry', '4512192863', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4512192863/white-water-turquoise-sterling-silver?click_key=c065112a-15db-4334-805f-33d9023ef7d2%3ALT34ab0c4774b669a2a8a2f9ab078d6807dd7a4ffd&click_sum=e0a1bfe3&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=turquoise+jewelry&ref=search_grid-750041-16-5&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=c065112a-15db-4334-805f-33d9023ef7d2%253ALT34ab0c4774b669a2a8a2f9ab078d6807dd7a4ffd',
   'White Water Turquoise Sterling Silver Ear Cuff | Boho Festival Jewelry', 'No piercing, no problem! This ear cuff was designed to be worn in the middle of the ear, similar to the conch piercing. The cuff is approximately 12mm in diameter with a 6mm opening and can be slightly adjusted to for a smaller of larger fit. This cuff features a Whote Water turquoise stone that is 6mm x 4mm. The cuff is light weight and is comfortable enough to wear all day. Please reach out with any questions! Caring for Sterling Silver Jewelry: Air exposure can tarnish sterling silver jewelry. Try to not leave it out where it can be exposed to air. It''s best to store silver in individual, air-tight bags with anti-tarnish properties, such as silica gel packets. If sterling silver jewelry does tarnish, it can be polished back to its original luster. To do this, use a microfiber cloth or special jewelry cloth (not paper towels or toilet paper) to clean your piece. Thank you for stopping by my shop! Feel free to contact me if you have any questions. Be sure to check out The Haute Bohemian on Instagram for sales and exclusive pieces. Follow THB on Instagram and Facebook Instagram @TheHauteBohemianJewelry Facebook @TheHauteBohemian', 'turquoise-jewelry',
