   'My S Collection 925 Sterling Silver, Marcasite & Turquoise Pendant with Chain', 'My S Collection 925 Silver Pendant set with turquoise & Marcasite stones with an oxidised chain Modern style with a vintage touch Size of the pendant (incl. the bale) 28mm x 12mm The necklace comes in a nice wrapping Please see other jewellery in My S Collection Thank you for considering My S Collection! My S Collection is an assembly of sterling silver jewellery selected with passion and love. I especially adore marcasite jewellery and most of my pieces are set with marcasite stones. I choose all pieces with an extreme care and make sure the quality is excellent. My S Collection is my hobby and each positive comment from my satisfied customer makes me feel very happy. Please feel free to ask questions about the products, comment and give new ideas. I would be happy to hear from you. Enjoy browsing through My S Collection! Anna - the owner My S Collection Jewellery can last a lifetime, but it need to be looked after. Wearing - Take off your jewellery when cleaning, bathing or swimming as chemicals such as chlorine can damage or discolour the metal and stones - Remove your jewellery before doing any sporting activities - Put your jewellery on at the last moment so that it is not discoloured or affected by perfume, lotions, makeup and hairspray - Do not wear your jewellery in bed Cleaning - Never clean your jewellery with modern, chemical or ultrasonic solutions - The best way to clean is by using a slightly damp cloth and then wipe dry immediately after with a soft cloth - Sterling silver will tarnish with time, but this will happen faster if your jewellery is in contact with perfume, skin creams, hairspray, salty air and chlorine - To revive the shine in sterling silver jewellery you can give it an occasional polish with a silver cloth Production partners MySCollectionShop makes this item with help from Manufactured, Thailand', 'turquoise-jewelry',
